# Exclusions for the Apache RAT check of the Apache Storm release archives, read by ATR
# (https://releases.apache.org). Paths are relative to the top directory of the archive.
# Keep this list in sync with the apache-rat-plugin excludes in the rat profile of pom.xml.

**/target/**
**/target/rat.txt
**/*.iml
**/.idea/**
**/*.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings/**
**/metastore_db/**
**/build/**
**/logs/**
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/README.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/README.markdown
**/DEVELOPER.md
**/RELEASING.md
**/BYLAWS.md
**/STORM-UI-REST-API.md
SECURITY.md
VERSION
TODO
